**Optimization 7: Use EAS Directly Instead of Custom Attestation System**

EAS is live on Base with 1M+ attestations. Using EAS from Day 1 would: (a) make attestations
interoperable with the broader Ethereum ecosystem, (b) eliminate custom Merkle anchoring
