Base L2 gas prices normally ~0.005 gwei but spikes to 50+ gwei during congestion. Batch
settlement of 1,000 txs at 50 gwei = ~$3.25 instead of $0.001 — 3,250x increase.

**Mitigation:** Gas price circuit breaker: if gas exceeds 10x the 7-day average, pause batch
settlement, extend window, alert operators. Resume when gas normalizes. Standard DeFi
practice but not in the plan.

